eeth  and their heads resemble those of mosses  like the tylosaurus each hand of the  skull crawlers have four clawed digits  in total  now let's compare their sizes their  length height and weight lizzie is  around 60 meters or 200 feet long the  giant skull crawler is also close to  that at 194 feet long what about the  height well many estimates put lizzy at  around 15 to 18 meters or 50 to 60 feet  tall while the big skull crawler is said  to be 95 ft tall but most of the time it  hunches down and crawls and therefore  looks to be around 60 feet itself the  weight of these two mosses will  determine which one has a mass advantage  lizzie is officially 150 tons while the  skull crawler is 33 percent lighter at  100 tons in weight  let's compare their abilities now both  these monsters were invulnerable to  small arms fire and were both able to  withstand 50 caliber machine gun fight  at them  so we can say that they were both very  durable and armoured in a way lizzie was  able to withstand anti-tank missiles  fired from a down apache helicopter  those ones call the hellfire missiles if  i'm not mistaken but the big one was  hurt by a flare although to its defense  it was fired directly at its eye but  anyhow i would say that lizzie had  thicker armor and was more durable  both these monsters don't have any fire  breathing abilities or any kind of  ranged weapons like beams or  lighting attacks or anything of that  sort  they were both hyper carnivorous though  with the skull crawlers taking the lead  in this field since its biology makes it  live in a state of constant starvation  the skullcrawler was also faster and had  a prehensile tail that it can use to  grab things with  on the other hand lizzy had a club-like  tail with spikes that it can use to  impale enemies lizzie also had the upper  hand in his bite force that was shown to  be able to rip a giant wolf's head clean  off of its body one advantage that the  skullcrawler might have is its  intelligence i