kes the win in a battle  against the skull crawler it could have  been a tough fight but in the end the  subtitle wouldn't have been able to sing  its teeth deep enough and with that we  come to the end of the video of the  comparison of the skullcrawler versus  lizzie the crocodile do hit that like  button for support and smash that  subscribe button to be a part of our  mind cue family also hit that bell  button for regular updates on new videos  till the next one take care fam
 

